    {"source_id":"D166-WAYVE-3D-SENSING-ROLE-2026-10-23","domain_id":"D166","publisher":"Wayve Careers (Ashby-hosted)","title":"Staff Robotics Engineer, 3D Sensing","url":"https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/wayve/08bd82d2-6896-4239-8efe-80249cc9fb90","source_family":"employer job posting / credible grey role-task evidence","locator":"Official Wayve Ashby-hosted posting inspected 2026-10-23; sensor calibration and 3D sensing duties include target/targetless LiDAR-camera calibration, temporal alignment, motion compensation, nonlinear optimization/factor graphs and evaluation across vehicles/environments.","supports":"Concrete role-task chain connecting sensor calibration and temporal synchronization to trustworthy 3D data for perception, reconstruction and ground-truth generation; illustrates traditional geometric and learned calibration alternatives.","claim_limit":"Senior employer-specific robotics position. It does not establish that every mechatronics engineer performs calibration or that Wayve's implementation represents all AV stacks.","credibility_assessment":"High credibility for Wayve's described role tasks because the employer's official recruiting page was directly inspected. It is one senior specialist posting; use for task context, not general role prevalence.","search_status":"official employer posting inspected 2026-10-23"},
    {"source_id":"D166-RIVIAN-AUTONOMY-SENSING-SYSTEMS-2026-10-23","domain_id":"D166","publisher":"Rivian Careers","title":"Autonomy Sensing Systems Engineer","url":"https://careers.rivian.com/careers-home/jobs/29594?lang=en-us","source_family":"employer job posting / credible grey role-task evidence","locator":"Official Rivian posting inspected 2026-10-23; requirements, sensor interfaces, calibration and DVP&R/validation sections for camera, radar, LiDAR, IMU and GNSS systems.","supports":"Area-context example for turning vehicle/feature needs into testable sensing-system requirements covering timing, packaging, calibration, environmental performance, diagnostics and lab/HIL/SIL/vehicle test outputs.","claim_limit":"One employer's sensor-systems workflow, not universal requirements or a standard. It is a role posting and is not used as independent evidence of area taxonomy or role fit.","credibility_assessment":"High credibility for Rivian's stated tasks because its official current careers page was directly opened. Single-employer and job-title limits remain; corroborate universal claims elsewhere.","search_status":"official employer posting inspected 2026-10-23"},
    {"source_id":"D166-GM-OPTICAL-SENSOR-TEST-2026-10-23","domain_id":"D166","publisher":"General Motors Careers","title":"Senior Advanced Optical Sensor Test & Development Engineer","url":"https://search-careers.gm.com/en/jobs/jr-202621090/senor-advanced-optical-sensor-test-development-engineer/","source_family":"employer job posting / credible grey role-task evidence","locator":"GM Careers JR-202621090, posted 2026-10-21; optical camera/LiDAR development test, image quality, latency/FPS, lab instrumentation, calibration and vehicle integration.","supports":"Sensor component test and characterization examples spanning optics, packaging, image quality, calibration and interfaces; connects component performance measurements to downstream AV/ADAS integration.","claim_limit":"Single GM posting and senior role; employer-specific tasks do not establish industry prevalence or define all optomechanical engineering.","credibility_assessment":"High credibility for GM's stated duties because the current employer-hosted careers page was directly opened. Use as a task example with seniority/employer limits.","search_status":"official employer posting opened 2026-10-23"},
