    {"source_id":"D166-ICRA-LMPC-ERROR-DYNAMICS-IAC-2024","domain_id":"D166","publisher":"IEEE International Conference on Robotics and Automation (ICRA) / IEEE Xplore","title":"Learning Model Predictive Control with Error Dynamics Regression for Autonomous Racing","url":"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10611628/","source_family":"peer-reviewed robotics conference paper","evidence_layer":"area_method_context","locator":"IEEE Xplore abstract/metadata inspected 2026-10-24; ICRA 2024. Reports closed-loop tests on a 1:10 vehicle and deployment on a full-scale IAC car at Putnam Park. Combines a nominal nonlinear physics model with locally learned linear error dynamics inside LMPC.","supports":"Shows learned residual/error dynamics complementing rather than replacing first-principles vehicle dynamics inside MPC; relates system identification/regression, optimization constraints, safe iterative exploration and real-vehicle evaluation.","claim_limit":"One paper and evaluation program; full text not available in this pass. It does not prove road transfer or imply learning must replace physics models.","search_status":"IEEE Xplore abstract and metadata inspected 2026-10-24; full text unavailable in this pass.","credibility_assessment":"Peer-reviewed ICRA paper; strong for the method and experiments summarized in the official abstract, with access limitation recorded.","current_pass_note":"Optional advanced branch after vehicle dynamics, state estimation, MPC and model-error concepts."},
