    {"source_id":"D011-BIS-LCR-CURRENT-2019","domain_id":"D011","publisher":"Basel Committee on Banking Supervision / Bank for International Settlements","title":"Basel Framework: Liquidity Coverage Ratio (current standard)","url":"https://www.bis.org/committees/bcbs/basel-framework/standard/lcr","source_family":"international prudential standard / official consolidated framework","evidence_layer":"area_standards_and_learning","locator":"Current LCR standard page opened 2026-10-24; effective 15 December 2019, status current. LCR20 covers calculation and reporting; LCR30 qualifying HQLA; LCR40 the denominator of net cash outflows in a specified 30-calendar-day stress scenario.","supports":"A distinct quantitative liquidity-risk measure and reporting framework: qualifying HQLA are related to stressed net cash outflows; local scope, currency, transfer restrictions and national implementation govern its application.","claim_limit":"Bank-specific prudential standard, not a general portfolio market-risk estimator. Basel Committee standards require jurisdictional implementation and do not automatically bind every financial firm or jurisdiction.","credibility_assessment":"Primary Basel Framework standard source; authoritative for framework content, status and effective date, subject to local implementation."},
