    {"source_id":"D011-BIS-OPE25-FUTURE-2027","domain_id":"D011","publisher":"Basel Committee on Banking Supervision / Bank for International Settlements","title":"Basel Framework Timeline: forthcoming OPE25 Standardised Approach (2027)","url":"https://www.bis.org/committees/bcbs/basel-framework/timeline?chapter=25&standard=OPE","source_family":"official standard-change timeline / forthcoming prudential framework version","evidence_layer":"area_standards_and_learning","locator":"Past/future changes timeline opened 2026-10-24; lists the OPE25 standardized operational-risk capital approach, version published 5 July 2024, forthcoming effective date 1 January 2027. The page separately lists the current OPE25 version effective 1 January 2023.","supports":"A concrete scheduled future standards item for monitoring operational-risk capital requirements; it permits source-grounded curriculum to distinguish currently effective rules from a future-effective framework version.","claim_limit":"Timeline status does not establish the exact national transposition date, local enforceability or every substantive change; detailed future-version text and jurisdiction-specific implementation must be checked before teaching operational requirements as current.","credibility_assessment":"Primary Basel Committee framework-change timeline; authoritative for its listed publication/effective/status dates, not local legal effect."},
